      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "Cliff from Arlington, Virginia, USA",
      "description": "You cannot actually get to the blowhole itself, so the best place to actually view the blowhole is at the lookout. From the lookout you can not only easily view the blowhole, but also have some truly breathtaking views of the east side of the island. In addition to spectacular views, keep an eye out for some of the local wildlife. During the winter time the look out at Halona Blowhole is an excellent place to views humpback whales.",
